<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Faction - Elves integrations. This folder only loads when Faction - Elves is active (see loadFolders.xml); each block sits in a subfolder gated on its partner mod. Gene adds skip a xenotype that already has the gene.
		  - With Big and Small - Framework: extended lifespan (LongLifespan) runs B&S's truly ageless gene class, so a carrier's
		    biological age is held at 25 at most (B&S checks every 500 ticks). Its own lifespan curve, age-disease immunity
		    and fertility factor are def fields and keep working. Only set when the gene has no geneClass of its own.
		    Pawns already in a save keep the gene class they were saved with; new pawns and new carriers get the effect.
		  - With Alpha Genes: the high elf gains low mining yield, clean, frail back and golden hair; the celestia elf gains
		    deep black skin, frail back, clean, low mining yield and psy-sensitive (vanilla's PsychicAbility_Enhanced, kept
		    under this gate on request); the wild elf gains low mining yield and high survival instinct; the dark elf gains
		    deep black and deep purple skin, low mining yield and night striding.
		  - With Big and Small - Genes & More: the high elf gains uninsultable; the celestia elf gains uninsultable, marble
		    white skin and blinding white hair (a B&S gene; Alpha Genes has none); the wild elf gains animal friend; the dark
		    elf gains dark gray and blinding white hair, fast darkness healing and night owl.
		  - With Genes & More and VRE - Lycanthrope: MMMM Convergence - Genetics retires BS_NightOwl to Cherry Picker in
		    favour of VRE_Nocturnal, so the dark elf's night owl becomes VRE_Nocturnal here. It runs right after the add, in
		    this file, so the result does not depend on the order of the Integrations and Convergence mods.
		The dark elf's strong melee damage -> darkness improved melee swap is in MMMM Convergence - Genetics.
		Verified 2026-10-23 (all four elves) against Faction - Elves 1.6, Alpha Genes 1.6, B&S Framework and Genes & More 1.6: every gene
		exists, none of the added genes is on the elves already, and none shares an exclusion group with an elf gene
		(fast darkness healing is in the wound-healing group; no elf has a healing gene).
	-->
	<!-- Big and Small - Framework: extended lifespan gains the truly ageless effect. -->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
		<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="LongLifespan"][not(geneClass)]</xpath>
		<match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
			<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="LongLifespan"][not(geneClass)]</xpath>
			<value>
				<geneClass>BigAndSmall.TrulyAgeless</geneClass>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
